# Open in VS Code and click "Send Request" (REST Client extension).
# Local run (dotnet run): http://localhost:5501   Through Traefik: http://localhost:8000
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Health (checks MongoDB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/health

### Last 50 audit events from MongoDB (one per email sent or failed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/audit
